# Output Format
Return only JSON matching {{ schema | tojson }}.
The approaches array must contain exactly {{ count }} entries. Count them before finishing.
Every entry has exactly these keys: hypothesis, mechanism, change, test.
Keep each field to one short sentence, about 20 words or fewer. No extra commentary.
Complete the JSON object and stop immediately after the {{ count }}th entry.
When repairing the latest failed partition, preserve its usable entries: correct invalid
fields, remove only excess entries, or add only the missing entries needed for the quota.
Return the complete corrected partition; do not append a second list of alternatives.
